 "syn": {
  "unchained goddess": "The Unchained Goddess (1958) is a color television film about what weather is and how it works. It was the fourth and last film in the Bell System Science Series produced by Frank Capra, who wrote the screenplay with Jonathan Latimer. Unlike the first three films in the series, it was directed by Richard Carlson, who also appears in it, with series host Frank C. Baxter. It was televised on February 12, 1958. Recent commentators have noted that the film shows an early concern with climate change caused by human activities."
 },
